@TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@csrfToken = replace-with-request-token-from-csrf-response

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/status
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/trakt/login

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/trakt/callback?code=example&state=example

###

### After logging in, copy requestToken from the response into @csrfToken above.
GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

###

DELETE {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/trakt
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/movies?sort=rating&direction=desc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/shows?sort=watchedAt&direction=desc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/movie/top?limit=10&minimumRating=8
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/show/top?limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/movie/export.csv?sort=rating&direction=desc
Accept: text/csv

###

POST {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/refresh

### Personal Rewind JSON export (feeds the stand-alone personal-rewind viewer)

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/movie/export.json
Accept: application/json

### Simkl movie export (large exports return a ZIP containing CSV parts)

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/movie/export.csv?format=simkl&sort=title&direction=asc
Accept: text/csv, application/zip

### Simkl show export (LastEpWatched uses the latest watch in the year, e.g. S04E08)

GET {{TraktMyYear.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/year-reviews/2026/show/export.csv?format=simkl&sort=watchedAt&direction=desc
Accept: text/csv, application/zip
